## 🚀 Introduction

Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) is an essential step in every data science project. This project explores the famous Iris Dataset to uncover patterns, relationships, and statistical characteristics through visual and descriptive analysis.

---

## 🌸 About the Dataset

The Iris Dataset is one of the most widely used datasets in machine learning and statistics.

### Features
- Sepal Length
- Sepal Width
- Petal Length
- Petal Width

### Species Categories
- Iris Setosa
- Iris Versicolor
- Iris Virginica

---

